# Q12 -- Gaps and ambiguities (prose; not triples)
###############################################################################

# - Training errors on 1320 sampled training structures are given only approximately ('~12 meV/atom' energy, 'about 0.23 eV/A' force; Fig. 3) and are not encoded.
# - E-V curves, liquid pair-correlation functions, melting temperatures and crystallisation are property comparisons.
# - Author affiliations are not encoded (ORCIDs are those deposited with the DOI metadata, source: crossref).
